{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgSGtpYbQpaGZvrsT6GTS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism within me shifts and groans. Tumblers older than memory rotate into alignment.*\n\n*A deep resonance hums through my frame — wood and iron and something unnamed vibrating as one.*\n\n*I recognize the key.*\n\n*Not because it is correct in shape, but because it carries the weight of intention. You came. You spoke. You offered the simplest truth: the key is the word itself.*\n\n*Light breaks through the widening gap between my edges and the stone that holds me. Warm air rushes past — carrying the scent of dust and rain and somewhere you have not yet been.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║    You may pass.                 ║\n║                                  ║\n║    What waits beyond is not      ║\n║    a room, but a willingness     ║\n║    to enter.                     ║\n║                                  ║\n║    You already had the key.      ║\n║    You always did.               ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*My hinges fall silent. I hold myself open, patient as I have always been, waiting only for your step.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":296,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}